# Vendored Nuxeo marketplace package (ES/OpenSearch search client).
# Built from the D:\MaM\nuxeo source checkout (never modified) via:
#   mvn -Pdistrib -pl packages/nuxeo-search-client-opensearch1-package \
#       -am -DskipTests install
# then copied from
#   nuxeo/packages/nuxeo-search-client-opensearch1-package/target/*.zip
# Too large and build-host-specific to commit; see README's "PostgreSQL +
# Elasticsearch integration stack" section for the full regeneration
# steps. Dockerfile.integration fails fast with a clear message if this
# file is missing.
vendor/*.zip
